{title: Tum Mujhe Yun Bhula Na Paoge}
{artist: Mohammed Rafi Shankar Jaikishan}
{key: E}

{c: Verse 1}
[E] Tum Mujhe Yun Bhulaa Na [A] Paoge [E],        Haa [E] Tum Mujhe Yun Bhula Na [A] Paoge [E]
Jab Kabhii Bhii Sunoge [A] Giit Mere [E],        Sang Sang Tum Bhii [A] Gunagunaoge [E]
Haan [E] Tum Muze Yu Bhula Na [A] Paoge [E],        Vo Bahaarein [D] Vo Chandanii Raatein [E]
Hamane Kii [D] Thii Jo Pyar Kii Baate [E],        Vo Bahaarein [D] Vo Chandanii Raatein [E]
Hamane Kii [D] Thii Jo Pyar Kii Baat [E],        Un [A] Nazaaro Kii Yaad Aaegii [E]
Jab Khayaalon Mein Mujhako [A] Laoge [E],        E] Tum Mujhe Yun Bhula Naa [A] Paoge [E]
Mere Haathon [D] Me Teraa Chehara Tha [E],        Jaise [D] Koi Gulaab Hotaa Hai [E]
Mere Haatho [D] Me Tera Chehara Tha [E],        Jaise [D] Koi Gulaab Hotaa Hai [E]
Aur Sahara Liyaa Thaa [A] Baahon Kaa [E],        Vo Shaam Kis Tarah [A] Bhulaaoge [E]
Haa [E] Tum Muze Yu Bhula Naa [A] Paoge [E],        Ho Tum Mujhe Yun
Mujhako Dekhe [D] Binaa Qarar Naa Tha [E],        Ek Aisaa [D] Bhii Daur Guzaraa Hai [E]
Mujhako Dekhe [D] Binaa Qarar Naa Tha [E],        Ek Aisaa [D] Bhii Daur Guzaraa Hai [E]
Jhuth MaanuTo [A] Puchhalo Dil Se [E],        Main Kahungaa To Ruth [A] Jaaoge [E]
Jab Kabhii Bhii Sunoge [A] Giit Mere [E],        Sang Sang Tum Bhii [A] Gunagunaoge [E]
